{
  "_comment": [
    "Reference shape of a Flight Recorder CASE/UCO bundle, for readers who want",
    "to see the structure without running a capture. This file is documentation:",
    "the exporter builds bundles programmatically in case_uco.go and validates",
    "them before writing. Values below are illustrative.",
    "",
    "Namespace note: InvestigativeAction and ProvenanceRecord live in",
    "case-investigation in the published CASE 1.3.0 ontology. Fields with no",
    "home in the published ontology use the documented fr: extension namespace."
  ],
  "@context": {
